<title>USA: DeKalb Genetics to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>DeKalb Genetics to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>DEKALB, Ill. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeKalb Gentics Corp, a biotechnology company, said Friday its class B common stock has been approved for listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Trading on the NYSE will begin Monday, June 16, under the symbol &quot;DKB,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>DeKalb shares were down 3/4 at 75-1/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
